<title>USA: Southwestern Energy unit files for rate hike.</title>
<headline>Southwestern Energy unit files for rate hike.</headline>
<dateline>FAYETTEVILLE, Ark. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associated Natural Gas Co said Friday it has filed an application with the Arkansas Public Service Commission to implement a rate increase totaling $1.6 million annually for its northeast Arkansas operating district.</p>
<p>The company said the rates proposed represent an overall increase of about 10.32 percent.</p>
<p>Associated Natural is a subsidiary of Southwestern Energy Company and serves about 20,000 customers in northeast Arkansas.</p>
</text>
